Package: mdspace
Type: Package
Title: Multidimensional Scaling with Interactive Visualization
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Koji", "Kosugi", , "kosugitti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5816-0099"))
Description: Provides various multidimensional scaling (MDS) algorithms
    including classical MDS (Torgerson), nonmetric MDS (Kruskal), individual
    differences MDS (INDSCAL), ellipse model (Okada-Imaizumi), HFM (Chino),
    and von Mises model (Shojima). Includes an interactive Shiny application
    for GUI-based analysis and visualization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kosugitti/mdspace,
    https://kosugitti.github.io/mdspace/
